<title>USA: Revere ups copper/zinc base prices in products.</title>
<headline>Revere ups copper/zinc base prices in products.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Revere Copper Products Inc said it raised the published base prices for all copper and copper alloy mill products to reflect copper at $1.29 a lb, up 3 cents, and zinc at 85 cents a lb, up 2 cents, effective June 26.</p>
<p>((New York Commodity Desk 212-859-1646))</p>
</text>
